sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant UI as Frontend UI
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database
    participant SP as Service Provider

    Client->>UI: Search service
    UI->>API: GET /services
    API->>DB: Fetch services
    DB-->>API: Service list
    API-->>UI: Return services
    UI-->>Client: Display services

    Client->>UI: Select provider
    UI->>API: GET /providers
    API->>DB: Fetch providers
    DB-->>API: Provider list
    API-->>UI: Return providers

    Client->>UI: Book service
    UI->>API: POST /booking
    API->>DB: Save booking
    API->>SP: Notify provider

    SP-->>API: Accept booking
    API->>DB: Update booking status

    API-->>UI: Booking confirmed
    UI-->>Client: Show confirmation